Chat: {
	HarvesterPhase3: The Hollow Harvester tears its cloak open. The last harvest begins.
	ScarabPhase2: The sun in the Sultan's legs cracks open!
	ScarabDown: The Scarab Sultan has fallen. The dunes are quiet.
	RimePhase2: The wind rises off the mountain...
	RimeDown: The snowfields fall quiet.
	ShellbackPhase2: The Old Shellback's mast snaps - and it only gets angrier!
	ShellbackDown: The Old Shellback sinks back beneath the waves...
	HarvesterPhase2: The Hollow Harvester tears its scythe free. Nothing in its reach is safe now.
	HarvesterDown: The Hollow Harvester has been cut down. The field is quiet.
	Ronin0: A sword asks you to come close. A scythe asks you to stay exactly where you are.
	Ronin1: Strike with the edge. Anything nearer than that is only leaning on the handle.
	Ronin2: My lord is dust. The field, at least, still needs cutting.
	Ronin3: Stand still long enough and the blade will tell you when. Mine always does.
	Ronin4: The skeleton under the dungeon is gone, so I can sell you the rest of my kit. I kept it for someone who could carry it.
	DormantEyeOpens: The lid splits. Something under the stone is awake.
	DormantEyeDown: The Dormant Eye has been cracked open.
	KeeperPhase2: The shell splits. The eye will not close again.
	KeeperPhase3: Something inside the Keeper tears open.
	WeaverPhase2: The Weaver drives four legs into the ground and hides behind its own cloth.
	WeaverPhase3: The anchors come loose. The Weaver stops weaving and starts running.
	FirstKeeperPhase2: The lids grind apart. It has stopped pretending it cannot see you.
	FirstKeeperPhase3: The First Keeper throws away its shell. Nothing is hidden from here.
	BreachBegin: The stone gives way. The Breach is open.
	BreachWave2: The mouths widen. More is coming through.
	BreachWave3: The crack will not hold. Whatever is left is coming now.
	BreachHeave: Something under the third wave stands up. The floor is coming with it.
	HeavePhase2: The Heave stops letting its plates fall back.
	BreachWon: The Breach closes.
	BreachFailed: The Breach seals itself. Nobody was left to hold it open.
	Sifter0: Everything you are carrying used to be somewhere else. So did I.
	Sifter1: Rock is rock. Mine came further, that is all.
	Sifter2: You keep opening it. I am not going to be the one to tell you to stop.
	Sifter3: It is open right now. You could be down there instead of here.
}

TownNPCMood: {
	Ronin: {
		Content: The rice is poor and the roof is good. I have known worse bargains.
		NoHome: A ronin sleeps under the sky. He would still rather not.
		FarFromHome: This is not my house, and I have walked far enough today.
		LoveSpace: An open field. Room to swing.
		DislikeCrowded: Too close. Someone will lose an ear.
		HateCrowded: In this crowd my blade is a liability, and so am I.
		LikeBiome: The forest is quiet. I like a place that does not talk back.
		DislikeBiome: The snow gets into the lacquer.
		LikeNPC: "{NPCName} sews a good seam. My armour has needed one for years."
		DislikeNPC: "{NPCName} tried to sell me my own sickle."
	}

	Sifter: {
		Content: I am content. The stone here is dull, but it holds still.
		NoHome: I have nowhere to put anything down.
		FarFromHome: I am too far from my own walls.
		LoveSpace: There is room to spread a haul out here.
		DislikeCrowded: There are too many of you standing on my floor.
		HateCrowded: I cannot move without treading on somebody.
	}
}

